MIN.NVIM
========

This is a minimal version of my daily neovim setup. It is being purposefully
stripped down to make it portable. Although it contains some plugins. Those are
the bare minimum for my convenience.

Requirements
------------
NVIM v0.12.x or above

Installation
------------
	git clone https://github.com/saifshahriar/nvim-min nvim --depth=1
	mv nvim $HOME/.config/nvim
